[
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.048,
                0.058,
                0.331,
                0.12
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "卷烟真假鉴别方法"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.046,
                0.176,
                0.152,
                0.216
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "一、看包装"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.083,
                0.232,
                0.63,
                0.274
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 真烟包装方正平整，搭口整齐；假烟包装不规则，搭口粗糙",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.288,
                0.609,
                0.33
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 真烟商标图案清晰，字迹分明；假烟图案模糊，字迹不清",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.046,
                0.398,
                0.152,
                0.442
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、看烟丝"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.083,
                0.456,
                0.649,
                0.498
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 真烟烟丝颜色均匀，光泽油润；假烟烟丝颜色不均，缺乏光泽",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.512,
                0.65,
                0.554
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 真烟烟丝宽度均匀，无杂质；假烟烟丝宽窄不一，含较多碎末",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.046,
                0.622,
                0.152,
                0.664
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、闻气味"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.083,
                0.68,
                0.529,
                0.722
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 真烟有自然的烟草香气；假烟有刺鼻的化学气味",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.736,
                0.49,
                0.778
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 真烟点燃后烟气柔和；假烟点燃后辛辣刺喉",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.048,
                0.848,
                0.152,
                0.89
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "四、查防伪"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.083,
                0.904,
                0.389,
                0.946
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 查看激光防伪标识是否清晰完整",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.96,
                0.33,
                1.0
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2.扫描二维码验证产品真伪",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
